WEBVTT

00:00:00.408 --> 00:00:05.935
In this video, you will add photos to an event you posted, and learn where to find your events.

00:00:05.935 --> 00:00:06.917
We start on the map.

00:00:07.869 --> 00:00:09.543
Start at SoCal Lights dot app.

00:00:12.572 --> 00:00:15.119
On the home page, tap Use my location.

00:00:16.845 --> 00:00:17.825
Then tap Allow.

00:00:21.860 --> 00:00:24.642
Look at the top of the map, beside the search box.

00:00:24.642 --> 00:00:27.226
See your picture, or your initial, in a circle?

00:00:27.226 --> 00:00:27.769
Tap it.

00:00:29.534 --> 00:00:31.256
In the menu, tap Your events.

00:00:33.142 --> 00:00:35.600
It opens the events you added.

00:00:35.600 --> 00:00:37.009
Here is your event.

00:00:37.009 --> 00:00:40.170
It says whether it is on the map, and it shows the buttons for it.

00:00:40.924 --> 00:00:41.758
Tap Edit.

00:00:43.828 --> 00:00:45.547
Find the Photos box.

00:00:45.547 --> 00:00:47.603
You can add up to four photos.

00:00:47.603 --> 00:00:51.718
Photos are saved right away, so you do not need to tap Save.

00:00:51.718 --> 00:00:55.364
Tap Add photos, and choose pictures from your phone or computer.

00:00:57.016 --> 00:00:58.971
The first photo is the cover.

00:00:58.971 --> 00:01:02.740
It is the picture on the map list and at the top of your event page.

00:01:02.740 --> 00:01:05.711
To use a different one, tap Cover on it.

00:01:05.711 --> 00:01:07.900
To take a photo off, tap the x on it.

00:01:09.636 --> 00:01:15.115
Your photos show first on the map and on the event page, credited to the organizer.

00:01:15.115 --> 00:01:19.675
If you remove them all, the picture from your event's web page comes back.

00:01:19.675 --> 00:01:26.301
If your event is cancelled or postponed, choose that on the event, so visitors do not drive out for nothing.

00:01:26.301 --> 00:01:27.428
You can clear it later.

00:01:28.323 --> 00:01:31.001
That is how you manage an event you posted.

00:01:31.001 --> 00:01:34.288
Your photos show first on the map and on the event page.

00:01:35.633 --> 00:01:37.267
Next up: Show off your home.
